  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"assets\\st0104_db878031ec5b.png\" style=\"width: 810px; height: 309px;\" /></p><p>Phenol and its derivatives react at para position with phthalic anhydride. In $\\mathrm{p}$-cresol para position is blocked. So reaction not possible.</p>"
